{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50290","headline":"夏（原作「冬」）日野望 · 佚名","name":"夏（原作「冬」）日野望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出户过河梁，登高试望乡。\n云随愁处断，川逐思弥长。\n晚吹低藂草，遥山落夕阳。\n徘徊噎不语，空使泪沾裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}